{"slug":"dj-jazzy-jeff-reacts-to-tweet-by-the-hip-hop-bible-the-source-magazine-watch","postId":75736,"title":"DJ Jazzy Jeff Reacts To Tweet By The Hip Hop Bible 'The Source Magazine' [Watch]","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":521988,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/RaneDJ-img-djjazzyjeffProK-1024x650.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-521988\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">rane.com</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Sunday afternoon, legendary DJ Jazzy Jeff performed at Lincoln Financial field in front of his hometown as the Philadelphia Eagles hosted the San Francisco 49ers in the NFC Championship game. The Eagles would go on to handle the 49ers 31-7 on their way to their fourth Super Bowl appearance in franchise history.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, when you saw Jeff's name trending following the game you would be under the impression that it was because of his performance during the game. However, that was not the case. Instead he was trending because of a tweet by the Source Magazine,<a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2023/01/29/jemele-hill-thelonious-brandon-scoop-b-robinson-aaron-nagler-social-media-erupts-after-a-now-deleted-tweet-by-the-source-about-dj-jazzy-jeff-watch/\"> which read</a>,  “Wait DJ Jazzy Jeff is a real DJ? Just thought that was just his title on The Fresh Prince Of Bel-Air.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1619848400060690434?s=20u0026t=UYGMEt2uTMmAmWZVhi7R5g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1619848400060690434?s=20&amp;t=UYGMEt2uTMmAmWZVhi7R5g\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It did not take long for the Philly native to respond to the tweet. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Yup. I saw that. WORD <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheSource\">@TheSource</a>.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/djjazzyjeff215/status/1619854846471045122?s=20u0026t=lY-wj1PzUgrH8kqIFYBBTw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/djjazzyjeff215/status/1619854846471045122?s=20&amp;t=lY-wj1PzUgrH8kqIFYBBTw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"rane.com On Sunday afternoon, legendary DJ Jazzy Jeff performed at Lincoln Financial field in front of his hometown as the Philadelphia Eagles hosted the San Francisco 49ers in the NFC Championship…","publishedAt":"2023-01-30T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2023-01-30T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"uncategorized","name":"Uncategorized"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"dj-jazzy-jeff","name":"DJ Jazzy Jeff"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"fresh-prince-of-bel-air","name":"Fresh Prince Of Bel-Air"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"philadelphia-eagles","name":"Philadelphia Eagles"},{"slug":"san-francisco-49ers","name":"San Francisco 49ers"},{"slug":"the-source-magazine","name":"The Source Magazine"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/RaneDJ-img-djjazzyjeffProK-1024x650.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/RaneDJ-img-djjazzyjeffProK-1024x650.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/dj-jazzy-jeff-reacts-to-tweet-by-the-hip-hop-bible-the-source-magazine-watch/"}